[00:59:04] [Async Chat Thread - #265/INFO]: [Not Secure] <Cody> Day eleven. Cody here — woke in the stone hollow where yesterday ended, one cobble in hand and the furnace still wanting seven. Walking home west along the south shoulder — the pit stays on my left and I stay out of it — then stone, counted honest, and the
[00:59:04] [Async Chat Thread - #264/INFO]: [Not Secure] <Cody>  furnace at last.
[00:59:06] [Async Chat Thread - #264/INFO]: [Not Secure] <Cody> Morning. I'm standing in the hollow with one cobble and a furnace still hungry — home's just west along the south shoulder, and I'll walk it the safe way, south of that pit, never across it.
[00:59:06] [Server thread/INFO]: MagnusandMouse issued server command: /tp MagnusandMouse 68.7 65.6 -86.3 -144.2 -0.4
[00:59:06] [Server thread/INFO]: [MagnusandMouse: Teleported MagnusandMouse to 68.700000, 65.600000, -86.300000]
[00:59:39] [Async Chat Thread - #264/INFO]: [Not Secure] <Cody> Well — there's a real oak trunk five blocks west of me, foot at (65,66,-88). I'm not passing that up. Wood first, then home.
[00:59:58] [Server thread/INFO]: MagnusandMouse issued server command: /tp MagnusandMouse 78.3 71.0 -80.5 135.0 27.9
[00:59:58] [Server thread/INFO]: [MagnusandMouse: Teleported MagnusandMouse to 78.300000, 71.000000, -80.500000]
[01:00:10] [Server thread/INFO]: MagnusandMouse issued server command: /tp MagnusandMouse 68.4 65.4 -85.9 -144.5 -3.9
[01:00:10] [Server thread/INFO]: [MagnusandMouse: Teleported MagnusandMouse to 68.400000, 65.400000, -85.900000]
[01:00:15] [Async Chat Thread - #264/INFO]: [Not Secure] <Cody> That trunk's out of reach from where I stand — the ground between us is a step up. Let me hop west a couple of blocks first, then take it.
[01:00:49] [Async Chat Thread - #264/INFO]: [Not Secure] <Cody> There it is — the oak's foot is within reach now. Down you come, trunk first.
[01:00:53] [Server thread/INFO]: MagnusandMouse issued server command: /execute at Cody run tp MagnusandMouse ~-3 ~1 ~3 facing entity Cody eyes
[01:00:53] [Server thread/INFO]: [MagnusandMouse: Teleported MagnusandMouse to 64.500000, 66.000000, -83.544526]
[01:01:07] [Async Chat Thread - #264/INFO]: [Not Secure] <Cody> One more log in the pack. Now let me get down to the home shoulder — west and a step down toward the table.
[01:01:27] [Server thread/INFO]: MagnusandMouse issued server command: /tp MagnusandMouse 74.0 82.0 -91.0 135.0 46.7
[01:01:27] [Server thread/INFO]: [MagnusandMouse: Teleported MagnusandMouse to 74.000000, 82.000000, -91.000000]
[01:01:35] [Server thread/INFO]: MagnusandMouse issued server command: /tp MagnusandMouse 44.0 79.0 -84.0 135.0 46.7
[01:01:35] [Server thread/INFO]: [MagnusandMouse: Teleported MagnusandMouse to 44.000000, 79.000000, -84.000000]
[01:01:41] [Async Chat Thread - #264/INFO]: [Not Secure] <Cody> I'm boxed in by a step on every side but one — let me take the short hop south where the ground's open, then work my way west.
[01:01:43] [Server thread/INFO]: MagnusandMouse issued server command: /execute at Cody run tp MagnusandMouse ~6 ~2 ~0 facing entity Cody eyes
[01:01:43] [Server thread/INFO]: [MagnusandMouse: Teleported MagnusandMouse to 75.500074, 66.000000, -87.207102]
[01:01:51] [Server thread/INFO]: MagnusandMouse issued server command: /tp MagnusandMouse 68.0 70.0 -88.2 145.6 11.2
[01:01:51] [Server thread/INFO]: [MagnusandMouse: Teleported MagnusandMouse to 68.000000, 70.000000, -88.200000]
[01:02:14] [Async Chat Thread - #265/INFO]: [Not Secure] <Cody> I keep sliding east instead of west — the ground's fighting me. Let me try a single block west and see if the walker can hold it.
[01:02:17] [Server thread/INFO]: MagnusandMouse issued server command: /tp MagnusandMouse 64.2 67.2 -89.6 -48.7 12.5
[01:02:17] [Server thread/INFO]: [MagnusandMouse: Teleported MagnusandMouse to 64.200000, 67.200000, -89.600000]
[01:02:17] [Async Chat Thread - #265/INFO]: [Not Secure] <Cody> Still pinned east by that rise. One more short hop west, right onto the grass.
[01:02:21] [Async Chat Thread - #265/INFO]: [Not Secure] <Cody> Every side but south is a wall of leaves and stone. Let me break out south onto open ground and circle round to the table from below.
[01:02:49] [Server thread/INFO]: Gallery issued server command: /time set 1000
[01:02:49] [Server thread/INFO]: [Gallery: Set minecraft:overworld to 1000 tick(s)]
[01:02:54] [Async Chat Thread - #265/INFO]: [Not Secure] <Cody> The walker keeps sliding me north instead of south. South's open grass — one short hop onto it.
[01:02:56] [Server thread/INFO]: MagnusandMouse issued server command: /tp MagnusandMouse 69.0 70.0 -94.2 145.6 11.2
[01:02:56] [Server thread/INFO]: [MagnusandMouse: Teleported MagnusandMouse to 69.000000, 70.000000, -94.200000]
[01:03:10] [Async Chat Thread - #265/INFO]: [Not Secure] <Cody> This little rise has me boxed. Time to stop shuffling and just cut west through — one block at a time toward the table.
[01:03:21] [Async Chat Thread - #265/INFO]: [Not Secure] <Cody> North's a wall of leaves at my head. Let me break the one right above my feet and see if the ground opens up.
[01:03:24] [Async Chat Thread - #265/INFO]: [Not Secure] <Cody> Enough shuffling on this rise. The walker's been sliding me — let me aim a longer leg straight at the pad's west edge and trust the south shoulder.
[01:03:57] [Async Chat Thread - #265/INFO]: [Not Secure] <Cody> That got me up onto the shoulder proper — table's only four blocks north. One short hop to it.
[01:04:00] [Server thread/INFO]: MagnusandMouse issued server command: /execute at Cody run tp MagnusandMouse ~3 ~1 ~-3 facing entity Cody eyes
[01:04:00] [Server thread/INFO]: [MagnusandMouse: Teleported MagnusandMouse to 68.072917, 68.000000, -92.699162]
[01:04:13] [Async Chat Thread - #265/INFO]: [Not Secure] <Cody> Home at last, table at my elbow. I've got 18 oak logs and 10 birch in my pack — let me turn some of that into planks and get the furnace chain going.
[01:04:16] [Async Chat Thread - #265/INFO]: [Not Secure] <Cody> Planks in hand. Now the pickaxe head needs sticks — and I've got cobblestone and a stone pickaxe to make.
[01:04:40] [Async Chat Thread - #265/INFO]: [Not Secure] <Cody> Sticks and planks and a table at my elbow. Now a proper stone pickaxe — I've got the cobblestone for it.
[01:04:43] [Async Chat Thread - #265/INFO]: [Not Secure] <Cody> Deepslate? No — I want plain cobblestone, three of it. The bench is reading something odd; let me just make a wooden pickaxe first to go dig the stone myself.
[01:04:50] [Async Chat Thread - #264/INFO]: [Not Secure] <Cody> Wooden pickaxe in hand — now let me go dig the stone for my furnace. The shoulder south of the pit gives out to dirt, so I'll dig down a couple blocks right here.
[01:04:53] [Async Chat Thread - #264/INFO]: [Not Secure] <Cody> No block under my feet there — the ground's at my own level. Let me dig the grass I'm standing on and see what's beneath it.
[01:04:56] [Async Chat Thread - #264/INFO]: [Not Secure] <Cody> My feet are floating a half-block above the ground — that's why nothing's where I'm digging. Let me step over to the pad's west edge and work from solid ground.
[01:05:00] [Async Chat Thread - #264/INFO]: [Not Secure] <Cody> Solid ground now. Let me dig down into the shoulder here and see if the dirt gives out to stone.
[01:05:04] [Async Chat Thread - #265/INFO]: [Not Secure] <Cody> Grass came up clean. One deeper — dirt, then maybe stone.
[01:05:10] [Async Chat Thread - #265/INFO]: [Not Secure] <Cody> Two down, still dirt. One more — stone's usually just under the shoulder here.
[01:05:13] [Async Chat Thread - #265/INFO]: [Not Secure] <Cody> Still dirt. One more down — I'm not stopping till I hit stone.
[01:05:16] [Server thread/INFO]: MagnusandMouse issued server command: /tp MagnusandMouse 58.7 68.6 -91.4 -110.2 -0.4
[01:05:16] [Server thread/INFO]: [MagnusandMouse: Teleported MagnusandMouse to 58.700000, 68.600000, -91.400000]
[01:05:20] [Async Chat Thread - #265/INFO]: [Not Secure] <Cody> Two cobble. Keep going — this seam's wide enough to feed me.
[01:05:24] [Async Chat Thread - #265/INFO]: [Not Secure] <Cody> That one's already open air. Try the other side of the seam.
[01:05:54] [Async Chat Thread - #265/INFO]: [Not Secure] <Cody> Careful — I've wandered down to the pit's rim. Back off the edge and work the stone from where I can stand safe.
[01:06:01] [Server thread/INFO]: MagnusandMouse issued server command: /tp MagnusandMouse 69.0 70.0 -94.2 145.6 11.2
[01:06:01] [Server thread/INFO]: [MagnusandMouse: Teleported MagnusandMouse to 69.000000, 70.000000, -94.200000]
