[05:20:45] [Async Chat Thread - #278/INFO]: [Not Secure] <Cody> Day thirteen. Cody here — woke on the road home with fifteen cobble in my hand and the count DONE at last. West to my table, eight of them into a furnace at the bench, and the furnace set on my own pad beside it. Today’s the day it lands.
[05:20:46] [Async Chat Thread - #278/INFO]: [Not Secure] <Cody> Morning again, and this time I've got stone in my hand and a bench to use it at. Home's west — around the pit, south shoulder, same as always.
