[05:21:20] [Async Chat Thread - #278/INFO]: [Not Secure] <Cody> Walker balked at the broken ground — fine, short hops then. West a few paces, then I'll swing south around that pit like I mean it.
[05:21:24] [Async Chat Thread - #278/INFO]: [Not Secure] <Cody> West a bit more, then south to the shoulder — keep well clear of the pit's columns.
[05:21:28] [Async Chat Thread - #278/INFO]: [Not Secure] <Cody> On the south shoulder now, west of the pit's columns. North to the bench — the table's just up there.
