[05:22:35] [Async Chat Thread - #278/INFO]: [Not Secure] <Cody> Table's seven north of me. One more hop up onto the bench.
[05:22:42] [Server thread/INFO]: MagnusandMouse issued server command: /tp MagnusandMouse 62.3 67.6 -83.8 -134.1 -0.4
[05:22:42] [Server thread/INFO]: [MagnusandMouse: Teleported MagnusandMouse to 62.300000, 67.600000, -83.800000]
[05:23:09] [Async Chat Thread - #279/INFO]: [Not Secure] <Cody> There's a lip of grass right at my north — one block up. I'll step up onto it.
[05:23:12] [Async Chat Thread - #279/INFO]: [Not Secure] <Cody> The walker keeps reading my feet one level low. Fine — I'll dig the block in front of me and step up onto the bench myself.
[05:23:16] [Async Chat Thread - #279/INFO]: [Not Secure] <Cody> Dug out a step. Now I'll walk into it and up onto the bench.
[05:23:49] [Async Chat Thread - #279/INFO]: [Not Secure] <Cody> Still pinned at the same lip. I'll dig the next step out too and walk straight through the notch.
[05:23:50] [Server thread/INFO]: MagnusandMouse issued server command: /tp MagnusandMouse 72.4 73.0 -77.9 135.0 27.9
[05:23:50] [Server thread/INFO]: [MagnusandMouse: Teleported MagnusandMouse to 72.400000, 73.000000, -77.900000]
[05:23:53] [Async Chat Thread - #279/INFO]: [Not Secure] <Cody> Two steps dug now. Let me try walking down into the notch and up the far side.
