[05:24:26] [Async Chat Thread - #279/INFO]: [Not Secure] <Cody> Walker's stuck on the same lip no matter what I dig. The column tops read +1 north — I'll just pillar up one and get over it.
[05:24:31] [Async Chat Thread - #279/INFO]: [Not Secure] <Cody> Pillar won't take. Enough of this lip — I'll try the diagonal: north-east a couple of blocks, off this seam entirely.
