[05:24:49] [Server thread/INFO]: [Gallery: Set minecraft:overworld to 1000 tick(s)]
[05:25:06] [Async Chat Thread - #279/INFO]: [Not Secure] <Cody> Now I'm a block lower and east. The ground north reads +1 — one short hop up there should do it.
