[05:25:08] [Server thread/INFO]: [MagnusandMouse: Teleported MagnusandMouse to 68.100000, 66.600000, -88.700000]
[05:25:09] [Async Chat Thread - #279/INFO]: [Not Secure] <Cody> Small hops work where long ones don't. Hopping north, one seam at a time, toward the table.
[05:25:43] [Async Chat Thread - #279/INFO]: [Not Secure] <Cody> It won't step north from here — that's a +2 wall in front of me. I'll dig the block I'm facing at head height and open the seam.
[05:25:45] [Async Chat Thread - #279/INFO]: [Not Secure] <Cody> Nothing at head height there — so the wall's lower than I feared. Try the north hop again, just one block in.
[05:25:48] [Async Chat Thread - #279/INFO]: [Not Secure] <Cody> Little hops, that's the trick. One more north, then west toward my table.
