[05:25:51] [Async Chat Thread - #279/INFO]: [Not Secure] <Cody> I'm hopping in place, not gaining ground. The seam west is one down — let me try the low way round instead of pushing north.
[05:25:54] [Async Chat Thread - #279/INFO]: [Not Secure] <Cody> West is open now — ground drops away there. Let me get down off this lip and walk the low shoulder.
[05:26:28] [Async Chat Thread - #278/INFO]: [Not Secure] <Cody> Well, I went east instead of west — this ground's a mess of steps. But look, there's a birch trunk right south of me. Wood's the thing I came for.
